{"id":"u-d5de2254-3c03-417a-b3de-be2b98379312","src":"community","title":"The Valmet Protocol: Train Like a Hired Gun","author":"Zoya Nafar","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/agEP3U-the-valmet-protocol-train-like-a-mercenary","desc":"The program aims to develop functional strength, endurance, and body control in the spirit of the mercenary Valmet from the anime Jormungand. Bodyweight-only workouts help strengthen the muscles of the arms, back, shoulders, core, and legs, while improving posture, stability, and overall resilience.\n\nThe program suits both complete beginners (gradual load increase with emphasis on proper technique) and those with some prior experience. You'll progress in push-ups, back work, squats, planks, and general endurance — all of which build real-world strength that comes in handy in life.\n\nFeel free to adjust the number of reps and sets to adapt the program to yourself. Start small so you don't stop on the path of self-improvement.\n\nThe main advantages are minimal equipment, a flexible schedule, and the development of discipline and confidence in your body. Be inspired by Valmet's character: become stronger, more enduring, and more resilient.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["At Home"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-09T07:38:08.764Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5","Day 6","Day 7"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":6,"x":2},{"r":15,"rpe":6.5}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":6},{"r":10,"rpe":6.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hip Bridge March","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":6},{"r":15,"rpe":6.5},{"r":15,"rpe":7}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":6.5,"x":2},{"sec":60,"rpe":7}]},{"n":"Reverse Nordic Curl","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7},{"r":8,"rpe":7.5},{"r":8,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Superman","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Sit Up","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":6},{"r":20,"rpe":6.5},{"r":20,"rp